        },
        {
          "text": " Nao wameambiwa habari zako, ya kwamba unawafundisha Wayahudi wote wakaao katika Mataifa kumwacha Musa, ukiwaambia wasiwatahiri watoto wao, wala wasizifuate desturi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
