                  "text": "Mdo 18:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wachukue watu hao, ujitakase pamoja nao, na kuwagharimia ili wanyoe vichwa vyao, watu wote wapate kujua ya kuwa habari zile walizoambiwa juu yako si kitu, bali wewe mwenyewe unaenenda vizuri na kuishika torati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
